  "goodToKnow": "Der Apotheker (die Apothekerin) is a pharmacist. Every German TV ad for medicine ends with the legally required line Zu Risiken und Nebenwirkungen lesen Sie die Packungsbeilage und fragen Sie Ihren Arzt oder Apotheker. German pharmacies (Apotheken) are recognisable by a red gothic A sign, and many medicines, even painkillers, are only sold there. Apothekenpreise means outrageously high prices. From Greek apotheke, storehouse."
